flowchart LR
  A["Initialized and unbound issue"] --> B["Typed recovery request with CAS"]
  B --> C{"Validate phase, history, reviewer proof, paths, and digests"}
  C -->|"fail"| D["No mutation; typed error"]
  C -->|"pass"| E["Atomically relocate byte-identical artifacts"]
  E --> F["Record prior reviewer provenance and invalidate approval"]
  F --> G["Append old/new audit envelope"]
  G --> H["Initialized and unbound; new generation and digest"]
  H --> I["Mandatory fresh design review and approval"]
  I --> J["Normal typed bind"]
